  "description": "FUVCUY crystallizes in the triclinic crystal system with space group P -1. Reported CIF formula moiety: C92 H80 Cl6 Cu2 Ho4 N6 O28,6(C2 H3 N1),2(C1 H4 O1). From the CIF bond table, Ho1 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho2 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Cu1 (Cu) has 5 O neighbors; Ho3 (Ho) has 7 O neighbors; Ho4 (Ho) has 8 O neighbors; Cu2 (Cu) has 5 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 6 pairs, 2 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.371-3.953 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 82.17-113.87°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C92H80Cl6Cu2Ho4N6O28·6(C2H3N)·2(CH4O). Explicit grouped units in the article formula/name: 2 OH (explicit grouped unit in article compound name (structural notation)).",
